<title>USA: Equity Residential buys eight properties.</title>
<headline>Equity Residential buys eight properties.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equity Residential Properties Trust said Friday it bought eight properties in separate transactions for a total purchase price of $120.2 million.</p>
<p>The properties in Yarmouth, Maine; Phoenix; Ft. Lauderdale, Florida; Kent, Washington and in the Portland, Oregon area, consist of more than 2,300 units, Equity Residential said.</p>
<p>The real estate investment trust said it has acquired 15 properties since the beginning of 1997 for a total purchase price of $256.8 million.</p>
<p>Equity Residential shares were unchanged Friday at 42-3/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
